OL,3,GNEWSAMiss England hopeful wants to win
OL,4,Ain second-hand outfits
OL,5,
OL,6,FLisa Austin used to model for Gucci.
OL,7,FNow she is scanning the rails of a
OL,8,Fcharity shop in Essex. Her eyes move
OL,9,Fquickly along the racks, pausing at
OL,10,Fpieces she thinks could help her stand
OL,11,Fout and get crowned Miss England 2026.
OL,13,FThe 25-year-old is attempting to win
OL,14,Fthe beauty pageant wearing outfits that
OL,15,Fare all second-hand.
OL,17,F"Last year, I bought a brand new
OL,18,Fwardrobe [for the pageant], but this
OL,19,Ftime I really did not want to do that,"
OL,20,Fshe says.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
